# RELEASE 02 (Security & Production Access Hardening) — the documented
# default DATABASE_URL/ASSET_STORE_URL paths (BUILD 18) land here: a real
# SQLite DB (structured intelligence, prompts, user accounts) and real
# uploaded/generated images. None of this belongs in source control, at any
# nesting depth — a project subdirectory choosing the same default path
# would previously have been committed by accident (docs/16, RELEASE 01
# finding).
